197 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (TraceOps is a data observability and investigation platform that helps users identify data-quality issues, trace data lineage, investigate incidents, and understand their potential root causes and business impact. The system is built with a React.js frontend and a Python FastAPI backend, with Exasol integration and demonstration data.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
198 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 146 0 R
/E (Users can view incidents, examine upstream and downstream lineage, review quality-check results, study investigation details with supporting evidence and root-cause hypotheses, and see the KPI impact of each incident. By bringing these activities into one workflow, TraceOps aims to make data incident investigation more organized, traceable, and easier to communicate.)
/Pg 13 0 R
/K [2]
>>
endobj
